.DS_Store
# Everything scripts/desktop.mjs has Wails generate on every build: the Windows
# manifest, icon and version resource, the macOS Info.plist and icon, the
# installer's helper macros and the WebView2 bootstrapper it carries, and the
# build output. What is committed is what Wails cannot write for us: the logo
# every icon is made from, the build configuration and the installer script.
desktop/build/*
!desktop/build/appicon.png
!desktop/build/config.yml
!desktop/build/windows/
desktop/build/windows/*
!desktop/build/windows/nsis/
desktop/build/windows/nsis/*
!desktop/build/windows/nsis/project.nsi
desktop/*.syso
webembed/dist/
test-results/
playwright-report/
